<p>Enter a blood frenzy, draining stamina quickly (-2 stamina/turn). Each time you kill a foe while in the blood frenzy, you gain a cumulative bonus to Physical Power of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 6, 8, 10.</acronym></p><p>Each turn, this bonus decreases by 2.</p>